        <p source="#source-28911-28994">『新潮』昭和<hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-28929-28960" corresp="#source-28931-28960"><seg source="#source-28929-28931">26</seg></hi><seg source="#source-28960-28963">・</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-28963-28994" corresp="#source-28965-28994"><seg source="#source-28963-28965">12</seg></hi></p>
